shed filled with fishing poles, life vests, balls, bats, horseshoes, and lots more<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5861\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5861\" class=\"wp-image-5861\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_122605.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>We assembled 400 &#8220;Goodie Bags&#8221; for the elementary school field trips<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5863\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5863\" class=\"wp-image-5863\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190512_151404.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>We repaired Invertebrate &#8220;Viewing Cups&#8221; that had been damaged during previous field trips<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5849\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5849\" class=\"wp-image-5849\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190424_110620-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>We used the Mule to  collect downed tree limbs after the winter storms<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190426_130208.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5850\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5850\" class=\"wp-image-5850\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190426_130208.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190426_130208-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190