\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5872\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5872\" class=\"wp-image-5872\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190501_174221.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Setting the form for an electrical sectionalizer<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5873\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5873\" class=\"wp-image-5873\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190506_095828.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Just some of the equipment these guys use to get the job done<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5874\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5874\" class=\"wp-image-5874\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190507_150246.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Scott on the back hoe<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5875\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5875\" class=\"wp-image-5875\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190508_094228.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Hooking up the power<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5876\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5876\" class=\"wp-image-5876\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/05\/20190510_103018.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Just one of the typical mundane maintenance jobs<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We enjoyed our time at Fort Peck.  The folks we worked with and for were very kind, professional, and courteous and they appreciated everything we did to help out.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We also made some great new friends.  Dan and Bev came in early May and were contracted as the paid Gate Attendants.  They&#8217;ve been full time RV&#8217;ers for 21 years!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5911\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/20190603_093456-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our new friends Dan and Bev Foster<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have any interest in working as a volunteer in exchange for your RV site and utilities, go to <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"www.volunteer.gov (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"http:\/\/www.volunteer.gov\" target=\"_blank\">www.volunteer.gov<\/a> where you can search by; state, agency, and position type.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for following along and remember to visit our You Tube channel herbnkathyrv to see some of the videos we&#8217;ve published lately.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy and I spent early spring 2019 as Camp Hosts at the Fort Peck Downstream Campground &#8211; Fort Peck Montana. This is a U.S. Army Corp of Engineers (USACE) Project and our campground is just one of the recreation areas at the project which includes Fort Peck Reservoir, Fort Peck Dam and spillway, the Interpretive &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/06\/17\/camp-hosting-at-fort-peck-montana\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Camp Hosting at Fort Peck, Montana<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,264,19546,554707329,30025],"tags":[554707754,554707266,554707738,554707757,18086,554707695,554707755,554707756,554707308,554707306,554707751,554707758,14157],"class_list":["post-5836","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-learning","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","category-working","tag-army-corp","tag-dam","tag-fort-peck","tag-interpretive-center","tag-lake","tag-montana","tag-mule","tag-ranger","tag-river","tag-stream","tag-usace","tag-visitor-center","tag-water"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5836","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5836"}],"version-history":[{"count":14,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5836\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5913,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5836\/revisions\/5913"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5836"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5836"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5836"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}